      "prompt": "In the rectangular coordinate plane, line $L_1$ is given by $y = 3x + 9$ and line $L_2$ is given by $y = -3x + 27$. Find the exact area of the triangle bounded by $L_1$, $L_2$, and the $x$-axis ($y = 0$).",
